      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">See how independent Calgary stucco contractors scope a repair: what the crack is telling them, whether a patch will hold, and when a wall needs more than a patch. Call (403) 555-0148 for a no-obligation quote.</p>
